[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0254","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0286","title":"Linux X Font Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"X Font Server (xfs) 存在输入验证缺陷，本地攻击者可通过向 xfs 的 Unix socket 发送特制的畸形数据，触发缓冲区溢出或服务崩溃，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RedHat Linux 6.x 及早期 Linux 发行版，需要本地用户权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0286"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 xfs 软件包至修复版本（Red Hat Linux 6.x 用户安装 RHSA 更新或升级至 xfs 版本 1.3.1 以上），或禁用 xfs 服务（`chkconfig xfs off`；`service xfs stop`）。如无法升级，在 `/etc/X11/fs/config` 中限制 `no-listen = tcp` 仅允许本地 socket 访问，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0079.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1111","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19850"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0254.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0253","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0284","title":"华盛顿大学 IMAPD 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"华盛顿大学 IMAP 服务器（UW-IMAP）的 imapd 组件 4.7 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。具有有效账户的攻击者可通过向 IMAP 服务发送特制的 LIST 或其他命令触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 WU-IMAP 2000.287 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者需先拥有目标系统的有效账户方可利用，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0284"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-16","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 UW IMAPD 至 4.7 以上已修复版本（如 imap-2000.287 之后的版本），或在无法升级时限制受信用户访问 IMAP 服务，并在网络层限制对 IMAP 端口（143/tcp）的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0074.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0085.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1110","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19847"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19847"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0253.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0806","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0260","title":"Microsoft Visual Interdev 1.0 Link View Server-Side 组件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Visual Interdev 1.0 的 dvwssr.dll 组件（Link View 服务器端组件）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 IIS 服务器发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务或执行任意命令。该漏洞也影响 Microsoft FrontPage 98 Server Extensions for IIS，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0260"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:20.640","remediation":"立即删除服务器上所有 Dvwssr.dll 文件（通常位于 %SystemRoot%\\system32 或 Program Files 目录下），该文件是 Visual Interdev 1.0 的 Link View 服务端组件，删除后仅影响 .asp 链接视图功能。如无法删除，建议升级至 Windows 2000 系统，或安装 FrontPage 2000 Server Extensions / Office 2000 Server Extensions 以消除此漏洞。同时检查 IIS 站点目录权限，确保非授权用户无法执行该 DLL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/282","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1109","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-025","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19845","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0260.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0260","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0260.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0260.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/967.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/frontpage_dvwssr.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0260.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0806.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0806.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0229","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0254","title":"Dansie Shopping Cart 3.0.4 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Dansie Shopping Cart 3.0.4 的 cart.pl 脚本存在信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 env、db 或 vars 等表单变量发送特制 URL 请求，无需任何身份认证即可获取购物车数据库及系统配置信息，导致敏感数据泄露。该漏洞利用方式简单，影响范围较广，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0254"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19.827","remediation":"建议立即升级 Dansie Shopping Cart 至最新版本（3.0.5 或更高），在 Apache/IIS 的 Web 根目录中移除或重命名 cart.pl 文件；如不再使用该软件，应彻底卸载并删除所有相关 CGI 脚本。在无法升级时，在 Web 服务器层限制对 cart.pl 的访问，仅允许授权 IP 请求该脚本，并在 Perl 脚本入口处过滤 env/db/vars 等敏感参数输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1115","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4954","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19852","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0254.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0254","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0254.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0254.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v93j-3f23-p5mq/GHSA-v93j-3f23-p5mq.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/dansie_cart.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0254.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001287.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4c93c92e-6eca-4fb4-a659-77bb57267063.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0229.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0229.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0226","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0250","title":"QSSL QNX 4.25 crypt 函数弱加密本地权限提升漏洞","description":"QNX 4.25 A 的 crypt() 密码加密函数使用了弱加密算法，本地攻击者可通过分析加密后的密码哈希值，利用加密算法弱点进行解密还原明文密码，从而获得其他用户（包括 root）的登录凭证，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 QNX 4.25 A 版本，需要本地访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0250"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:19.307","remediation":"建议升级至 QNX Neutrino 6.3 及以上版本，这些版本使用更强的 MD5 或 SHA 密码哈希算法替代原有的弱加密。如无法升级，可通过限制控制台/SSH 登录用户为受信任管理员，并启用系统审计日志监控 `/etc/shadow` 文件的异常读取行为作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0072.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1114","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19851","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0250.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0250","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0250.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0250.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p3hr-r8ch-hrrq/GHSA-p3hr-r8ch-hrrq.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1114/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0250.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0226.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0226.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0226.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0276","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0276.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0288","title":"Infonautics getdoc.cgi 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Infonautics 的 getdoc.cgi 脚本存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过修改表单变量（form variable）的值，绕过文档访问的付费验证阶段，从而未经授权获取付费文档内容。该漏洞属于参数篡改类型的认证绕过，攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可远程利用，对文档付费系统的访问控制机制构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0288"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24.260","remediation":"升级 getdoc.cgi 至最新版本，或修改脚本在服务端重新验证表单变量完整性，确保支付状态变量（如 payment_passed）不可由客户端提交修改。如厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至替代文档管理系统，并在 Web 服务器层限制对 getdoc.cgi 的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0049.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0288.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0288","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0288.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0288.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-63q9-pmq9-gfj5/GHSA-63q9-pmq9-gfj5.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0288.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001286.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0276.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0270","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0283","title":"SGI IRIX Performance Copilot 敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"IRIX Performance Copilot（性能监控工具）在默认安装配置中，其 pmcd 守护进程未设置有效的访问控制机制，导致远程攻击者可通过网络直接访问该服务，获取目标系统的敏感性能数据与系统信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可利用，影响 SGI IRIX 操作系统的多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0283"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23.630","remediation":"限制 pmcd 守护进程的网络访问，在防火墙上仅允许受信主机访问 TCP 4321 端口；如无需 Performance Copilot 功能则停止并禁用 pmcd 服务；升级 SGI 官方发布的安全补丁；对于仍运行 IRIX 的系统建议迁移至受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0056.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1106","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0283.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0283","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0283.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0283.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/irix_copilot.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r4wv-238c-4wf9/GHSA-r4wv-238c-4wf9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4f831d0f-2945-4421-89cd-6f0917b597ee.json",